rface, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\nf(t,y)=⟨x,y,z⟩=⟨4 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)},\\,y,\\,8 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)}⟩\n$$\n\nwhere $t\\in[0,2\\pi)$ and $y\\in(-\\infty,\\infty)$.\n\nTherefore, the third component of $f$ is $8 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)}$." 13194139536003 17592186045443 true] [17592186556046 1080 "\\cosh{\\left(t \\right)}" 13194139536003 17592186045443 true] [17592186556046 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536003 17592186045443 true] [17592186556046 1083 #uuid "d878bf6e-bca7-5958-bfc5-aa81e9e00f4a" 13194139536003 17592186045443 true] [17592186556047 1080 "6 z^{2}" 13194139536003 17592186045443 true] [17592186556047 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536003 17592186045443 true] [17592186556047 1083 #uuid "db96e8eb-5818-5d5a-b257-837eaea2a440" 13194139536003 17592186045443 true] [17592186556048 1080 "4 z^{2}" 13194139536003 17592186045443 true] [17592186556048 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536003 17592186045443 true] [17592186556048 1083 #uuid "e7325a3c-2971-5516-a37e-91be41f7ff2d" 13194139536003 17592186045443 true] [17592186556049 1080 "10 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)}" 13194139536003 17592186045443 true] [17592186556049 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536003 17592186045443 true] [17592186556049 1083 #uuid "f736708e-82e2-5dc4-adaa-e74882b04876" 13194139536003 17592186045443 true] [17592186556050 1168 "generate/scratch/17592186175970.py" 13194139536003 17592186045443 true] [17592186556050 1169 #uuid "7097852c-3733-5057-8e56-6a7c7a2ec7f2" 13194139536003 17592186045443 true]] :edb/tempids {"0124350a-8800-55e4-bf08-cf2f1a52a5c9" 17592186556008 "01f85af3-7dbf-51dc-b63d-4f1e71fad421" 17592186556009 "03bff836-d4cb-55d9-a1db-ad96236ed7f6" 17592186556010 "055565a1-d075-5a32-af9f-b388bf896da0" 17592186556011 "06ed7ef9-a964-530f-9d92-c37d0095d2ae" 17592186556012 "0eefd5df-54d9-5b92-b2f5-743afd73ef3b" 17592186556013 "0f0582dc-425f-5aa5-8efe-aedd32d4e4c1" 17592186556014 "16f20b6c-b303-5d0a-9813-babf53b46354" 17592186556015 "42089e4d-7340-5c78-acfd-e1e2